+    "text": "P = parameters taking part in the forward pass (for L: base plus adapters); T = non-padding tokens fed (training: fact tokens of the batch; anchor: anchor tokens). Arm A's anchor compute is listed separately: base forward 2 * P * T_anchor + trained-model forward and backward 6 * P * T_anchor.",
