+    "status": "ACCEPTED（Review Gate 2026-11-24）",
+    "text": "S's accuracy on its own mapping: for each learned fact f with S answer a' = answer of answer_fact_id, the DEV-QA questions of f and the TRAIN-statement prefix of f are scored with the candidate list of the fact a' belongs to (it contains a' and has 4 equal-length candidates); correct iff a' scores strictly highest. Report only.",
