+    "status": "ACCEPTED（Review Gate 2026-11-24）",
+    "text": "The model is loaded with attn_implementation='eager' (not the default 'sdpa') so that attention uses plain matmul and softmax under torch.use_deterministic_algorithms(True); this changes numbers at the 1e-6 level, not the definitions.",
