+    "status": "ACCEPTED（Review Gate 2026-11-24）",
+    "text": "Final status: PASS iff Gate 0 is PASS and T1-T3 hold; otherwise PIPELINE_NOT_QUALIFIED with reasons T1 -> OPTIMIZATION_OR_CAPACITY_UNRESOLVED (section 9 names T1's accuracy; the CI part is given the same reason), T2 -> IMPLEMENTATION_FAIL (the G0.6 / G0.7 numbers), T3 -> null with the recalibration note (as G0.3). T3's 'G0.3 的同样范围' is read as all four G0.3 ranges, Acc_CB(N) included (a TRAIN closed-book value that does not depend on TEST). TEST comparisons use the purpose split 'TEST'.",
